<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-TheraTech started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-TheraTech started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Vector Securities analyst Patricia Bank said she started coverage of TheraTech Inc with an attractive rating.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the drug delivery company were up 3/16 to 9-1/4.</p>
<p>-- &quot;The key driver for the stock in 1997 will be the possible announcement of another collaboration on ... transmucosal technology,&quot; Bank said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
